OL,3,GNEWSADesign studio turns Barbie dolls
OL,4,Ainto tech
OL,5,
OL,6,FA University of Brighton graduate is
OL,7,Fgiving unwanted Barbie and Ken dolls a
OL,8,Fsecond life, using their materials to
OL,9,Fmake colourful tech products.
OL,11,FTom Meades launched the Childhood
OL,12,FMemories Collection through his
OL,13,Fsustainable design studio, gomi.
OL,15,FThe studio teamed up with Mattel's
OL,16,FBarbie brand to transform materials
OL,17,Ffrom dolls and accessories into
OL,18,FBluetooth speakers, power banks, and
OL,19,Ftracker tags.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
